  "body": "## What\n\nThe catalog case `2d/adaptive-pocket` runs near its 60 s budget in the debug suite `app:example_catalog`.\n\n- Alone, `catalog_2d_adaptive_pocket::rebuilds` took 54.6 s and `::regenerates` took 55.2 s.\n- With other tests in parallel, on a machine with a load average of 24-30, the two tests failed: `did not finish within 60s; move this case to app heavy: example_catalog or reduce its model`.\n- The quick gate selects the whole suite when a file under `examples/catalog/` changes. So each catalog PR can see this failure on a loaded machine.\n\n## Evidence\n\nSeen during the gate of PR #3162 (#2856), on base 7d1f1d72c plus #3139. That PR changes only the `expect` line of the case.\n\n## Done means\n\nThe two tests finish with a clear margin under the budget in debug, or the case moves to the heavy lane as the budget message says.\n",
